e a lot of profit so  they should get back to the environment  they're contributing to the pollution so  they shouldn't do something about it but  some argue the only way to significantly  reduce the amount of plastic ending up  in our oceans is to use fewer bottles in  the first place Becky Johnson Sky News
 

